From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:54:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 189/220] [ae-patch] Show a lead's family as labelled rows at
 the top of the hover card

The family's session count, open count and total sat on one small grey line under the status, easy to miss now that the lead row shows only its name. The hover card now opens with a FAMILY block: Preset (when set), Sessions (N, M open) and the family total as Spend shows sets it (Tokens or Cost; none when off). The block is its own component, so a session that leads nothing reads no roles or usage.
